  "body": "## What's Changed\n\n- cockpit: show requested and free capacity in the Resources pane (#43) by Ferran Basora ([@fcsonline](https://github.com/fcsonline)) ([`1ad37aa`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/1ad37aa91188ece32d7c2295e920a4b9de108613))\n- fix: prioritize substring matching in fuzzy search (#48) by Carl Otto Strömstedt ([@carlottostromstedt](https://github.com/carlottostromstedt)) ([`9d1e874`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/9d1e8741e9cc52b058ca839672fbcdaf0713d2ad))\n- ui: sort absolute timestamps correctly (#47) by Carl Otto Strömstedt ([@carlottostromstedt](https://github.com/carlottostromstedt)) ([`ab419a7`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/ab419a77f03ab10e4bc1a58f61274d58620fa57a))\n- Update README.md by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`d1274a7`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/d1274a7b0894ae2f64f754c85d8a34f11da0d455))\n- Modify recommendation for Kubernetes UI by bjarneo ([@bjarneo](https://github.com/bjarneo)) ([`5223fa8`](https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/commit/5223fa8f3aaf6306637a6f637a897a40e022c96e))\n\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/bjarneo/ku/compare/v0.12.0...v0.13.0\n\n## Checksums (SHA256)\n\n```\n5ab6960f87acebd52c1334989cc09c9d2b02fe27f967a90409d7153586a062aa  ku-darwin-amd64\nf8633581a9c7ae5584d0ee0d3af201e3c087f9d70448161ac93330ffce237267  ku-darwin-arm64\ncbe35792ee860d36ed3e381d9229a6ad388abae6929527a0690bb4cf166faede  ku-linux-amd64\nee25a9225491c839c334db38314cb78d060aafb6f8a6ad9f0a0325656735dedc  ku-linux-arm64\nf5c4e733f9983a1df0ebcbd2a1f784d80941a5ff685345350373bdbe4948a43c  ku-windows-amd64.exe\n5a5d2396ec00cc201013ad788de6a94cfcbc30b97bebd96836f8aca4603be46b  ku-windows-arm64.exe\n```\n"
